our <strong>strategy </strong>with your <strong>friends </strong>by simply starting a game or continuing your older one, and friends <strong>can join through Steam</strong>. Sharing <strong>creations</strong>, <strong>fight </strong>become really <strong>interesting with friends</strong>!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704590/extras/a0ca4bef65f532ad5c07125677170537.poster.avif?t=1637581338\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704590/extras/a0ca4bef65f532ad5c07125677170537.webm?t=1637581338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704590/extras/a0ca4bef65f532ad5c07125677170537.mp4?t=1637581338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
